  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced.\n• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee86eba6118bd6bcb6f8e/step-39405900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut zucchini into half-moons. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place zucchini, potato and peeled & chopped pumpkin on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee86eba6118bd6bcb6f8e/step-df277710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Add sweet Asian spice blend, Japanese curry paste, coconut milk, the vinegar and water (for the curry) and cook, stirring to combine, until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins.\n• Add roasted veggies and gently stir to combine. Cook for 1 min. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee86eba6118bd6bcb6f8e/step-db4f1220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir the butter through the rice. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and Japanese pumpkin and coconut curry between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee86eba6118bd6bcb6f8e/step-d26e2230.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
